"Advertises spatial audio playback for FaceTime. Availability depends on the device and call." = "声明 FaceTime 空间音频播放支持，实际可用性取决于设备与通话。";
"Advertises the internal Settings bundle. May affect system services and does not install missing internal components." = "声明内部设置面板支持，可能影响系统服务，不会安装缺少的内部组件。";
"AI Expansion borrows an eligible device identity (iPhone 15 Pro class) so Settings can download the Siri AI models. The borrow is setup-only: after the download completes, open Restore → the recovery backup → “Restore Identity · Keep AI Keys”. Your real identity returns (Face ID and dictation recover) while every AI key stays — that combination is what keeps Image Playground and the dedicated Siri app installed. Do not keep the borrowed identity longer than the download: models are validated against the real hardware after the revert, and a permanent borrow is the documented reason the apps never appear. Speech resources downloaded under the borrow can wedge their languages; Device Doctor fixes that afterwards. A backup is saved before writing." = "“AI 扩展”会临时借用受支持的设备身份（iPhone 15 Pro 级别），以便在设置中下载 Siri AI 模型。借用仅用于下载：完成后请到“恢复”使用恢复备份中的“恢复身份 · 保留 AI 密钥”。真实身份会回来（面容 ID 和听写恢复），所有 AI 密钥保留——正是这一组合让图像游乐场和独立 Siri App 保持安装。借用身份不要超过下载所需时间：模型在身份还原后会按真实硬件校验，永久借用正是“App 一直不出现”的已确认原因。借用期间下载的语音资源可能使其对应语言失效，设备医生可以修复。写入前会先备份。";
"Restore Identity · Keep AI Keys" = "恢复身份 · 保留 AI 密钥";
"Restore Real Identity?" = "恢复真实身份？";
"Use this after the Siri AI model download completes. Your original device identity returns and Face ID and dictation work again after restarting. All Siri AI keys — including the iOS 27 expansion flag and the persistence keys — stay, so Image Playground and the dedicated Siri app remain installed. The current file will be backed up before writing." = "请在 Siri AI 模型下载完成后再使用。操作会恢复原设备身份，重启后面容 ID 和听写恢复；全部 Siri AI 密钥——包括 iOS 27 扩展标志和持久化密钥——都会保留，因此图像游乐场和独立 Siri App 会继续保留。写入前会备份当前文件。";
"This Siri AI identity backup belongs to a different device." = "这份 Siri AI 身份恢复备份属于另一台设备。";
"This device is already spoofed, but no original identity backup was found. Restore an original MobileGestalt backup before starting Siri AI setup again." = "设备已处于伪装状态，但未找到原设备身份备份。请先恢复原始 MobileGestalt 备份，再重新开启 Siri AI。";
"First, this will temporarily spoof an eligible device. Face ID and dictation may stop working while spoofed. Complete the Siri AI model download in Settings, then open Restore and use “Restore Identity · Keep AI Keys” on the recovery backup. After restarting, Face ID and dictation will work again while the AI keys — and any apps that appeared — stay in place. A separate full backup is also saved before setup. System instability is possible." = "将先临时伪装为支持的机型，期间面容 ID 和听写可能失效。请先在设置中完成 Siri AI 模型下载，再到“恢复”在恢复备份上使用“恢复身份 · 保留 AI 密钥”。重启后，面容 ID 和听写会恢复，AI 密钥——以及下载期间出现的 App——会保留。开启前还会按原方式保存一份完整备份。此过程可能导致系统不稳定。";

