/* Dictation-Safe Fork */
"Dictation-Safe Fork · Siri AI setup never spoofs device identity by default" = "听写安全分支 · Siri AI 开启过程默认不伪装设备身份";
"Activation Mode" = "开启方式";
"Dictation Safe" = "听写安全";
"Temporary Spoof" = "临时伪装";
"Dictation-safe mode writes only the Siri AI software flags (AI capability, SiriMode 2 and the Apple Intelligence persistence keys). Device identity is never modified, so Face ID, dictation and spoken Siri keep working. If Settings refuses to download the Siri AI models, switch the activation mode to “Temporary Spoof” or “AI Expansion”, complete the download, then finish with Restore → “Restore Identity · Keep AI Keys” and restart. Availability still depends on Apple's servers and region." = "听写安全模式只写入 Siri AI 软件标志（AI 能力、SiriMode 2 和 Apple 智能持久化密钥），不会修改设备身份，面容 ID、听写与语音 Siri 保持正常。如果设置中无法下载 Siri AI 模型，请将开启方式切换为“临时伪装”或“AI 扩展”，完成下载后在“恢复”中使用“恢复身份 · 保留 AI 密钥”收尾并重启。功能可用性仍取决于 Apple 服务器与地区。";
"Repair Dictation & Face ID" = "修复听写与面容 ID";
"Repair Dictation and Face ID?" = "修复听写与面容 ID？";
"Repair Identity" = "修复设备身份";
"Dictation & Face ID Repair" = "修复听写与面容 ID";
"Restores only the original device identity and the on-device Siri capability from this backup. Use this if dictation, spoken Siri or Face ID stopped working after a Siri AI device spoof from any editor. Siri AI, SiriMode and region settings stay enabled. The current file will be backed up before writing." = "仅从此备份恢复原始设备身份与设备专属的 Siri 本地能力。适用于任何编辑器伪装设备后听写、语音 Siri 或面容 ID 失效的情况。Siri AI、SiriMode 与地区设置保持不变。写入前会自动备份当前文件。";
"This backup's device identity does not match this physical device. Repair requires a verified original backup of this device, taken before any device spoof." = "备份中的设备身份与本机不符。修复需要本机在伪装前保存的、经验证的原始备份。";

