"The cache matches this hardware, so a leftover spoof is not the cause of any remaining dictation problem. Check Screen Time restrictions, dictation languages in Settings → General → Keyboard, and Siri settings." = "缓存与本机硬件一致，说明残留伪装不是听写问题的原因。请检查屏幕使用时间限制、设置 → 通用 → 键盘中的听写语言，以及 Siri 设置。";
"Review each value below. All of them come from this device's hardware report, a verified backup, or the built-in device database." = "请逐项核对下面的值。所有值均来自本机硬件报告、经验证的备份或内置设备数据库，绝不猜测。";
