"Belongs to the original hardware. If a spoofing editor added it, removing it can restore the on-device speech pipeline; offered as an optional fix." = "属于原始硬件的标记。若是伪装编辑器添加的，移除它有助于恢复本地语音管线；已作为可选修复提供。";
