// MARK: - Device Doctor v2（Siri AI 残留扫描、修复项与出厂缓存重置）
"Siri AI Capability Flag" = "Siri AI 能力标志";
"Written by Siri AI editors to force-enable generative Siri; stock caches never store it. With the new Siri runtime unavailable, this flag can wedge dictation and spoken Siri." = "由 Siri AI 编辑器写入用于强制开启生成式 Siri；原生缓存从不存储它。在新 Siri 运行时不可用时，此标志可能导致听写与语音 Siri 卡死失效。";
"Siri Mode" = "Siri 模式";
"Written by Siri AI editors (value 2 selects the new Siri pipeline). Removing it returns the speech stack to the standard pipeline." = "由 Siri AI 编辑器写入（值 2 选择新 Siri 管线）。移除后语音栈恢复为标准管线。";
"Device Region Code" = "设备地区代码";
"Region Sales Code" = "地区销售代码";
"Secondary Region Code" = "次要地区代码";
"Siri AI editors write LL to bypass region restrictions, but LL is also the genuine value for US-region devices. Remove it only if this device's real region is different." = "Siri AI 编辑器会写入 LL 以绕过地区限制，但 LL 也是美版设备的真实值。仅当本机真实地区不同时才移除。";
"Siri AI editors write LL/A to bypass region restrictions, but LL/A is also the genuine value for US-region devices. Remove it only if this device's real region is different." = "Siri AI 编辑器会写入 LL/A 以绕过地区限制，但 LL/A 也是美版设备的真实值。仅当本机真实地区不同时才移除。";
"Region marker rewritten by Siri AI editors for restricted regions. Removing it lets iOS recompute the real value after restart." = "受限地区设备被 Siri AI 编辑器改写的地区标记。移除后 iOS 会在重启时重新计算真实值。";
"Removes the leftover Siri AI activation flag so the speech stack runs the standard pipeline again. Siri AI can be re-enabled later from the Siri AI tab." = "移除残留的 Siri AI 激活标志，使语音栈恢复标准管线。之后可在 Siri AI 页重新开启。";
"Removes the stored region override; iOS recomputes the device's real region after restart." = "移除已存储的地区覆盖值；iOS 会在重启后重新计算真实地区。";
"Factory Cache Reset" = "出厂缓存重置";
"MobileGestalt cache cleared. Fully restart the iPhone — iOS rebuilds a native cache on boot. All MobileGestalt modifications are removed; Siri AI can be re-enabled afterwards." = "MobileGestalt 缓存已清空。请完整重启 iPhone——iOS 会在开机时重建原生缓存。所有 MobileGestalt 修改都会被移除；之后可重新开启 Siri AI。";
"Identity OK — Siri AI Keys in Cache" = "身份正常 — 缓存中存在 Siri AI 键";
"Identity Matches — Siri AI Keys Still in Cache" = "身份一致 — 缓存中仍保留 Siri AI 键";
"Siri AI Keys in Cache" = "缓存中的 Siri AI 键";
"Activation keys and region values written by Siri AI editors. With a clean identity, leftover activation keys are the leading cause of dictation and spoken Siri staying broken — removing them returns the speech stack to the standard pipeline." = "由 Siri AI 编辑器写入的激活键与地区值。在身份一致的前提下，残留的激活键是听写与语音 Siri 持续失效的首要原因——移除它们即可让语音栈恢复标准管线。";
"If Dictation Still Fails" = "如果听写仍然失效";
"The cache is clean, so any remaining dictation problem is outside MobileGestalt. Work through this list from the top." = "缓存是干净的，剩余的听写问题与 MobileGestalt 无关。请从上到下逐项排查。";
"After applying the fix and restarting, also work through this list — especially re-adding the failing dictation languages, whose speech resources were downloaded while the old keys were still active." = "应用修复并重启后，也请逐项检查此清单——尤其是重新添加失效的听写语言：它们的语音资源是在旧激活键仍生效时下载的。";
"Settings → General → Keyboard → Enable Dictation is on" = "设置 → 通用 → 键盘 → 已开启“启用听写”";
"Settings → General → Keyboard → Dictation Languages includes your language" = "设置 → 通用 → 键盘 → 听写语言已包含你的语言";
"Dictation fails in one language but works in another? Remove that language from Dictation Languages, restart, then re-add it on Wi-Fi — iOS re-downloads fresh speech resources for the repaired identity" = "某一种语言听写失效而另一种语言正常？请在“听写语言”中移除失效的语言，重启后再在 Wi-Fi 下重新添加——iOS 会为修复后的身份重新下载全新的语音资源";
"Settings → Screen Time → Content & Privacy Restrictions → Allowed Apps and Siri & Dictation are not restricted" = "设置 → 屏幕使用时间 → 内容与隐私访问限制 → 允许的 App 与“Siri 与听写”未受限制";
"Settings → Siri & Search: Siri is on" = "设置 → Siri 与搜索：Siri 已开启";
"Fully restart the iPhone (power off and on) after any cache change — speech daemons keep their state until then" = "任何缓存更改后请完整重启 iPhone（关机再开机）——在此之前语音守护进程会保持旧状态";
"If nothing helps: Factory Cache Reset below rebuilds a brand-new native cache" = "如果都无效：使用下方的“出厂缓存重置”重建全新的原生缓存";
"Last resort: removes every cached answer so iOS rebuilds a brand-new native cache on restart. All MobileGestalt edits are removed — Siri AI activation, region overrides, cosmetic tweaks. The current file is backed up automatically first." = "最后手段：移除所有缓存应答，让 iOS 在重启时重建全新的原生缓存。所有 MobileGestalt 修改都会被移除——Siri AI 激活、地区覆盖、外观修改。写入前会自动备份当前文件。";
"Factory Reset MobileGestalt Cache?" = "恢复出厂 MobileGestalt 缓存？";
"Clear Cache and Restart" = "清空缓存并重启";
"Every MobileGestalt modification is removed and iOS rebuilds a native cache after a full restart. Use this only if the doctor found nothing and dictation is still broken, or as the last resort after failed fixes. A backup is created first." = "所有 MobileGestalt 修改都会被移除，完整重启后 iOS 会重建原生缓存。仅在设备医生未发现问题而听写仍然失效时使用，或作为修复失败后的最后手段。写入前会先创建备份。";
"The cache is fully clean, so a leftover spoof or activation key is not the cause of a remaining dictation problem. Work through the checklist, then use Factory Cache Reset only as the last resort." = "缓存完全干净，残留伪装或激活键都不是听写问题的原因。请按排查清单逐项检查，仅在最后才使用出厂缓存重置。";
"The identity is clean, but leftover Siri AI activation keys can keep the speech stack in a pipeline this device cannot complete. Removing them is reversible — Siri AI can be re-enabled later from the Siri AI tab. Afterwards re-add each failing dictation language so iOS re-downloads its speech resources." = "身份正常，但残留的 Siri AI 激活键会让语音栈停留在本机无法完成的生成式管线上。移除后可随时恢复——之后可在 Siri AI 页重新开启。随后请重新添加每一条失效的听写语言，让 iOS 重新下载其语音资源。";
"Remove Siri AI Activation Keys" = "移除 Siri AI 激活键";
"Recommended: these keys were written by a Siri AI editor and keep the speech stack in the generative pipeline, which usually keeps dictation broken even when the identity is clean. Removing them is reversible — Siri AI can be re-enabled later from the Siri AI tab." = "建议开启：这些键由 Siri AI 编辑器写入，会让语音栈停留在生成式管线上——即使身份正常，听写通常也因此失效。移除后可随时恢复：之后可在 Siri AI 页重新开启。";
"Remove Region Overrides (LL)" = "移除地区覆盖值（LL）";
"Only enable this if this device's real region is not LL/US. iOS recomputes the genuine region after restart." = "仅当本机真实地区不是 LL/美版时才开启。iOS 会在重启后重新计算真实地区。";
"Removes the selected activation keys and writes the confirmed identity values to the MobileGestalt cache. The current file is backed up first. Restart the iPhone after this. Afterwards re-add each failing dictation language (remove it, restart, re-add on Wi-Fi) so iOS re-downloads fresh speech resources." = "移除所选的激活键，并将确认后的身份值写入 MobileGestalt 缓存。写入前会先备份当前文件。完成后请重启 iPhone。随后请重新添加每一条失效的听写语言（先移除、重启、再在 Wi-Fi 下重新添加），让 iOS 重新下载全新的语音资源。";
"More Siri AI Features" = "更多 Siri AI 功能";
"Also writes the on-device Siri capability flag with the next Enable Siri AI apply. Some Siri AI setups require it, but it drives the on-device speech pipeline and can wedge dictation or spoken Siri — Device Doctor → Fix Detected Errors removes it again." = "下次应用“开启 Siri AI”时会同时写入设备端 Siri 能力标志。部分 Siri AI 设置流程需要它，但它直接影响设备端语音管线，可能导致听写或语音 Siri 失效——如出现该情况，可通过设备医生 → 修复检测到的错误 再次移除。";
"Siri AI Feature Setup Guide" = "Siri AI 功能设置指南";
"Each step below needs the previous one. Work top to bottom after enabling Siri AI, and restart the iPhone after every cache change." = "以下每一步都依赖上一步。开启 Siri AI 后请从上到下依次操作，每次缓存更改后请重启 iPhone。";
"Setup" = "设置步骤";
"Activate Siri AI" = "开启 Siri AI";
"Set Siri language" = "设置 Siri 语言";
"Settings → Apple Intelligence & Siri → Language → English (New Zealand). It is an Apple Intelligence language and matches the dictation language that works on this device, so features and dictation stay consistent." = "设置 → Apple 智能与 Siri → 语言 → 英语（新西兰）。该语言受 Apple 智能支持，并且与本机可正常听写的语言一致，功能和听写可以保持一致。";
"Download the models" = "下载模型";
"Features that appear" = "解锁的功能";
"Image tools" = "图像工具";
"The new Siri app" = "全新 Siri";
"ChatGPT extension" = "ChatGPT 扩展";
"Settings → Apple Intelligence & Siri → ChatGPT → Set Up. Basic requests work without an account; signing in unlocks account features. Extra providers beyond what Apple serves to your region cannot be added from the device." = "设置 → Apple 智能与 Siri → ChatGPT → 设置。基础请求无需账号即可使用；登录后可解锁账号相关功能。Apple 未面向你所在地区开放的其他提供商无法从设备端添加。";
"Siri app actions" = "Siri 应用操作";
"This is Siri's expanded control over the phone: sending messages, editing notes, moving files and running in-app commands. Apps expose these actions as their developers adopt App Intents — there is no device-side switch for apps that lack the integration." = "这就是 Siri 对手机更全面的控制：发送信息、编辑备忘录、移动文件、执行 App 内命令。App 会随着开发者采用 App Intents 自动开放这些操作——未接入的 App 没有设备端开关可以强制开启。";
"On-screen awareness" = "屏幕感知";
"With the models downloaded, the new Siri reads the current screen and acts on it. If actions stay unavailable, recheck the Siri language from step 2 — awareness tracks the Siri language, not the keyboard language." = "模型下载完成后，新版 Siri 可读取当前屏幕并执行操作。如果操作始终不可用，请复查第 2 步中的 Siri 语言——屏幕感知跟随 Siri 语言，而不是键盘语言。";
"Personal context" = "个人情境";
"Settings → Apple Intelligence & Siri → enable the data Siri may use (Messages, Mail, Photos and more). Personal context is built on the on-device semantic index created after the model download; new data is indexed in the background." = "设置 → Apple 智能与 Siri → 允许 Siri 使用的数据（信息、邮件、照片等）。个人情境建立在模型下载完成后创建的设备端语义索引之上，新数据会在后台持续编入索引。";
"Camera intelligence" = "相机智能";
"Visual Intelligence needs its own model download plus a launch path your hardware supports (Camera Control, Action Button, Control Center or the Camera app, depending on the iOS version). Devices without the required hardware may never see it — no Gestalt edit can force it." = "视觉智能需要单独下载模型，并需要硬件支持的入口（依 iOS 版本不同，可能是相机控制按钮、操作按钮、控制中心或相机 App）。缺少所需硬件的设备可能永远看不到它——任何 Gestalt 修改都无法强制开启。";
"What cannot be forced" = "设备端无法强制的部分";
"On-Device Siri Understanding is also enabled: this flag drives the on-device speech pipeline and can wedge dictation or spoken Siri. Device Doctor → Fix Detected Errors removes it again if that happens." = "同时开启了设备端 Siri 理解：该标志直接影响设备端语音管线，可能导致听写或语音 Siri 失效。如出现该情况，可通过设备医生 → 修复检测到的错误 再次移除。";
"AI Expansion" = "AI 扩展";
"Dictation Safe never installs Image Playground or the dedicated Siri app: their eligibility checks require an eligible device identity, which this mode never writes. Choose Temporary Spoof or AI Expansion if you want those apps." = "“听写安全”永远不会安装图像游乐场和独立 Siri App：两者的资格检查都要求受支持的设备身份，而该模式从不写入设备身份。想要这些功能请选择“临时伪装”或“AI 扩展”。";
"AI Expansion is a two-phase unlock: while the borrowed identity is active, complete the Siri AI model download in Settings, then finish with Restore → “Restore Identity · Keep AI Keys”. The apps appear after that revert — keeping the borrow in place past the download is the documented reason Image Playground and the Siri app never appear." = "“AI 扩展”是两阶段解锁：借用身份生效期间，先在设置中完成 Siri AI 模型下载，然后用“恢复”→“恢复身份 · 保留 AI 密钥”收尾。还原之后这些 App 才会出现——借用身份超过下载所需时间而不还原，正是图像游乐场和 Siri App 一直不出现的已确认原因。";
"These recovery backups finish Temporary Spoof and AI Expansion: they restore your real identity while every Siri AI key stays. Face ID and dictation work again after restarting, and the apps that appeared during the download stay installed. Only removing the AI keys (Device Doctor → Fix Detected Errors) hides them again." = "这些恢复备份用于完成“临时伪装”与“AI 扩展”：恢复真实身份，同时保留全部 Siri AI 密钥。重启后面容 ID 和听写恢复，下载期间出现的 App 继续保留。只有通过设备医生 → 修复检测到的错误 移除 AI 密钥，才会让它们再次隐藏。";
"Tools → Region → Enable Siri AI → Apply, then restart. Dictation Safe only lights up the new Siri interface — it never downloads the models, because eligibility checks require an eligible device identity. For the apps pick Temporary Spoof or AI Expansion: the borrowed identity lets the model download start." = "工具 → 地区 → 开启 Siri AI → 应用，然后重启。“听写安全”只会点亮新 Siri 界面——它不会下载模型，因为资格检查需要受支持的设备身份。想要这些功能请选择“临时伪装”或“AI 扩展”：借用身份让模型下载得以开始。";
"Settings → Apple Intelligence & Siri → turn on Apple Intelligence and let the Siri and image models download over Wi-Fi (about 3 GB — keep it uninterrupted). Temporarily turn off Find My iPhone and Stolen Device Protection for the setup window, and make sure you are signed into your Apple Account. The download only passes while the eligible identity from step 1 is active — dictation-safe flags alone are never enough." = "设置 → Apple 智能与 Siri → 打开 Apple 智能，让 Siri 与图像模型在 Wi-Fi 下完整下载（约 3 GB，不要中断）。设置期间可临时关闭“查找我的 iPhone”与“失窃设备保护”，并确认已登录 Apple 账户。只有第 1 步中的受支持身份处于生效状态时，下载才能通过——仅靠“听写安全”的标志永远不够。";
"Finish the unlock: restore identity, keep AI keys" = "完成解锁：恢复身份，保留 AI 密钥";
"Restore tab → the recovery backup → “Restore Identity · Keep AI Keys”, then restart. The real identity returns while every AI key stays — that combination is what makes Image Playground and the dedicated Siri app appear. They appear AFTER this step, not while the borrow is active: keeping the borrowed identity past the download causes a model signature mismatch and the apps never show up. Then toggle Apple Intelligence off and back on once." = "“恢复”标签页 → 恢复备份 → “恢复身份 · 保留 AI 密钥”，然后重启。真实身份恢复且所有 AI 密钥保留——正是这一组合让图像游乐场和独立 Siri App 出现。它们在这一步之后才出现，借用期间不会：借用身份超过下载所需时间会导致模型签名校验失败，App 永远不会出现。完成后把 Apple 智能关一次再打开。";
"Image Playground appears as its own app and inside Messages; Genmoji is created in the emoji search field; Image Wand lives in the Notes drawing palette; Clean Up in Photos erases objects from pictures; Writing Tools work in most text fields once the image models are present. These survive the identity revert while the AI keys stay — only removing the keys (Device Doctor) hides them again." = "图像模型就绪后：图像游乐场会作为独立 App 并出现在信息中；Genmoji 在表情符号搜索栏创建；图像魔棒位于备忘录绘图工具栏；照片中的“清理”可抹除照片中的物体；写作工具可在大多数文本框中使用。身份还原后只要 AI 密钥保留，这些功能就会继续保留——只有通过设备医生移除密钥才会再次隐藏。";
"After the download AND the identity revert (step 4) the dedicated Siri app appears on the Home Screen and Siri becomes the full-screen experience with follow-up requests and type-to-Siri, with the conversation history synced across your devices via iCloud. If it is missing: the revert never happened, the models are still downloading, or the Siri language from step 2 was never applied — the new design is language-gated. Toggle Apple Intelligence off/on once and restart." = "模型下载完成且完成第 4 步身份还原后，独立 Siri App 会出现在主屏幕，Siri 变为全屏新界面，支持连续追问与键入 Siri，对话历史通过 iCloud 在你的设备间同步。如果没有出现：可能是身份还未还原、模型仍在下载，或第 2 步的 Siri 语言没有设置——新界面受语言限制。把 Apple 智能关一次再打开并重启。";
"No device-side edit can force server-gated features: availability still depends on Apple's servers and your Apple Account region. Siri AI is not available in China mainland and is not initially available in the EU for iPhone and iPad — no Gestalt edit changes that, and a China-mainland or EU Apple Account can keep the apps away even with every key set. Hardware-gated features such as Visual Intelligence may also never appear. Only removing the AI keys (Device Doctor → Fix Detected Errors) hides the apps again; the identity revert keeps them." = "任何设备端修改都无法强制受服务器限制的功能：可用性仍取决于 Apple 服务器与 Apple 账户地区。Siri AI 在中国大陆不可用，iPhone 和 iPad 上在欧盟初期也不可用——任何 Gestalt 修改都改变不了这一点；中国大陆或欧盟的 Apple 账户即使所有密钥齐全也可能让 App 不出现。视觉智能等硬件限制功能也可能永远无法出现。只有通过设备医生 → 修复检测到的错误 移除 AI 密钥才会让 App 再次隐藏；身份还原会保留它们。";
